1822
01:31:04,003 --> 01:31:06,836
(in.)

1823
01:31:09,303 --> 01:31:11,303
It dropped right on the line!

1824
01:31:11,303 --> 01:31:12,236
An ace serve!

1825
01:31:17,170 --> 01:31:18,236
Nice serve!

1826
01:31:18,236 --> 01:31:20,770
Go, Hyeon Jeong! Nice serve!

1827
01:31:21,270 --> 01:31:22,970
