- Absolutely.

1835
01:31:43,770 --> 01:31:45,603
Our serve is getting better.

1836
01:31:45,603 --> 01:31:48,003
Wonder Eagles.
No, the Wonder Dogs' serves...

1837
01:31:48,003 --> 01:31:50,403
