1838
01:31:50,403 --> 01:31:51,736
Did you just say Wonder Eagles?

1839
01:31:52,703 --> 01:31:54,636
The gap is now five points.

1840
01:31:56,336 --> 01:31:58,603
(Chae Yeon's serve)

1841
01:32:02,436 --> 01:32:03,403
Go!

1842
01:32:05,270 --> 01:32:07,070
Na Hee passes again!

1843
01:32:07,736 --> 01:32:09,136
(Slide attack)

1844
01:32:09,536 --> 01:32:10,570
They dig it up.

1845
01:32:12,036 --> 01:32:12,936
It's a rally.

1846
01:32:13,236 --> 01:32:14,136
Moving away from the net,

1847
01:32:14,136 --> 01:32:15,370
