1856
01:32:39,303 --> 01:32:41,970
(Diving dig)

1857
01:32:42,736 --> 01:32:44,436
(Ha Kyung's hustle play)

1858
01:32:45,636 --> 01:32:47,670
(Thanks to her,
Altos got a chance to attack.)

1859
01:32:50,203 --> 01:32:51,270
(No way!)

1860
01:32:53,103 --> 01:32:54,736
Another chance to attack!

1861
