1869
01:33:09,736 --> 01:33:10,736
Come on, Song Hee!

1870
01:33:10,736 --> 01:33:11,770
Song Hee!

1871
01:33:13,336 --> 01:33:14,603
Spike!

1872
01:33:18,203 --> 01:33:21,570
