- Send it over!

1873
01:33:21,570 --> 01:33:23,003
Nice! We have to send it over!

1874
01:33:29,136 --> 01:33:32,336
(It's out.)

1875
01:33:41,270 --> 01:33:42,536
(Clapping)

1876
01:33:42,536 --> 01:33:45,136
Nice defense. The defense is going great.

1877
01:33:46,703 --> 01:33:48,736
They did so well.

1878
01:33:49,836 --> 01:33:52,370
You have to score a point
in this kind of mega rally...

1879
01:33:52,370 --> 01:33:54,370
