- That's right.

1880
01:33:54,370 --> 01:33:57,670
As the game goes on,
the players are reading the flow better.

1881
01:33:57,670 --> 01:33:59,670
They're sprinting towards the ball more...

1882
01:33:59,670 --> 01:34:03,103
