1893
01:34:30,770 --> 01:34:31,670
Double.

1894
01:34:31,670 --> 01:34:33,203
You go in and pass the ball.

1895
01:34:33,203 --> 01:34:34,703
- On the right?
- Yes.

1896
01:34:35,436 --> 01:34:38,903
Or we can switch and put you on the left.

1897
01:34:38,903 --> 01:34:42,003
