a bit funny.

1915
01:35:41,736 --> 01:35:43,103
(Fine. Let's make it more interesting.)

1916
01:35:43,936 --> 01:35:45,836
I'm not going to come up with excuses.

1917
01:35:45,836 --> 01:35:48,103
I'm going to win fair and square.

1918
01:35:49,336 --> 01:35:52,003
