Seung Ju, go!

1922
01:36:01,003 --> 01:36:01,870
They sent it over.

1923
01:36:02,270 --> 01:36:03,336
Chae Won saves the ball.

1924
01:36:04,436 --> 01:36:06,636
Min Kyoung's spike.

1925
