Stay on the same track, Seung Ju.

1941
01:36:50,370 --> 01:36:55,036
Coach, please step off the court.

1942
01:36:55,036 --> 01:36:56,303
(My bad.)

1943
01:36:57,236 --> 01:36:59,203
