1944
01:37:02,970 --> 01:37:03,903
Back set.

1945
01:37:04,603 --> 01:37:05,536
Spike.

1946
01:37:06,836 --> 01:37:07,936
They lost the point.

1947
01:37:08,403 --> 01:37:11,103
