1957
01:37:40,488 --> 01:37:42,421
(Altos scores again.)

1958
01:37:44,121 --> 01:37:45,121
My bad, my bad.

1959
01:37:45,121 --> 01:37:46,432
(After a fierce back-and-forth)

1960
