2000
01:40:05,188 --> 01:40:07,121
- There's no reason to be nervous.
- Yes.

2001
01:40:07,121 --> 01:40:08,988
We can just start over!

2002
01:40:08,988 --> 01:40:09,972
In 1, 2, 3.

2003
01:40:09,996 --> 01:40:10,954
(Let's go, Wonder Dogs!)

2004
01:40:10,954 --> 01:40:12,421
We can start over!

2005
01:40:13,088 --> 01:40:15,654
(They unite and head back onto the court.)

2006
01:40:16,854 --> 01:40:17,688
Let's go!

2007
01:40:17,688 --> 01:40:20,154
(We can't lose this one.)

2008
01:40:20,154 --> 01:40:21,721
- Let's go!
- Sure.

2009
01:40:22,588 --> 01:40:25,121
For the second set,
setter Choi Yeon Jin is in.

2010
01:40:27,954 --> 01:40:32,154
