2015
01:40:47,388 --> 01:40:48,488
Serve!

2016
01:40:49,854 --> 01:40:51,054
The second set begins.

2017
01:40:54,588 --> 01:40:55,454
It's okay.

2018
01:40:55,921 --> 01:40:57,521
Na-Yeon tosses to the other side.

2019
01:40:57,521 --> 01:40:59,121
The connection isn't very smooth.

2020
01:41:02,221 --> 01:41:03,288
