2021
01:41:03,288 --> 01:41:04,221
A strong spike!

2022
01:41:04,754 --> 01:41:07,854
(Bumbling and stumbling!)

2023
01:41:08,221 --> 01:41:09,121
And a successful attack.

2024
01:41:09,921 --> 01:41:12,354
My bad on the pass.

2025
01:41:12,354 --> 01:41:13,921
Na-Yeon, take it slow!

2026
01:41:13,921 --> 01:41:15,354
Why are you so...

2027
01:41:16,088 --> 01:41:18,921
The pass is shaky,
and they can't find their rhythm.

2028
01:41:20,388 --> 01:41:21,421
Serve!

2029
01:41:21,421 --> 01:41:22,654
(Choi Yeon Jin's serve follows.)

2030
01:41:25,886 --> 01:41:26,886
It was too long.

2031
01:41:27,188 --> 01:41:29,088
- It was a mistake!
- Let's go!

2032
01:41:29,088 --> 01:41:31,588
(At least, it's the Wonder Dogs'
first point of the second set.)

2033
01:41:31,588 --> 01:41:32,554
The score is 1 to 1.

2034
01:41:32,554 --> 01:41:33,721
(Feeling awkward)

2035
01:41:34,154 --> 01:41:36,588
Don't hesitate on the serve,
just go for it!

2036
01:41:37,088 --> 01:41:38,321
Why are you so nervous?

2037
01:41:38,321 --> 01:41:42,421
- You can't enter the court.
- My apologies.

2038
01:41:42,754 --> 01:41:43,988
(As she's speaking,)

2039
01:41:43,988 --> 01:41:46,388
